SUMMARY: A Night for Venezuela & Colombia: Musical Bingo & Dance Party w/
  Nyhtnurse / olasconola / Ana Luisa / Momocita / Derby Duro / La Rumba Bu
 ena Crew
DESCRIPTION:Musical Bingo and Dance Party Fundraiser\n\nJoin us for a nig
 ht of music and food\, in solidarity with Venezuela & Colombia 🇻🇪🇨🇴\n
 \nVeneno Club\, La Rumba Buena\, Sonic Sancocho\, Marikass\, Changó and C
 reaTO are coming together to raise funds for organizations working on the
  ground in the neighbouring countries 🤝\n\nThough media coverage and mas
 s donations have decreased\, thousands affected and displaced continue to
  need support.\n\nLet’s make our Toronto community’s love be felt far and
  beyond! ❤️\n\nSchedule:\n\n8pm: doors and food\n\n9:00pm: musical bingo 
 starts (SHARP start time!)\n\nThen we party until 3am!\n\nYour ticket dir
 ectly supports those affected\, 100% of profits will be donated to verifi
 ed organizations working on the ground and providing earthquake aid relie
 f.
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,Bingo/Games-Night,Cafeteria
