SUMMARY: Wedding Playlist Music Trivia + Dance Party at The Rec Room
DESCRIPTION:From YMCA to Gimme Gimme Gimme... sing and dance to all of th
 e wedding classics.\n\n\nThis event is WEDDING FORMAL ATTIRE. The cheesie
 r the better! Wear your WEDDING DRESS\, a bridesmaids dress\, ANYTHING FU
 N that you've been holding on to! Yes\, your host Quizmaster Jess will be
  in her wedding dress \;).\n\n\nSong clip with EVERY question.\n\nTOP 3 T
 EAMS WIN A $100 REC ROOM GIFT CARD\n\n\nTRIVIA\n\n  * Time: Doors open 6:
 00pm\, first question 7:00pm\n  * $15 Trivia ticket (inlcudes Trivia & Da
 nce Party) (+tax & eventbrite fees)\n\n\nDANCE PARTY\n\n  * Time: 10pm ki
 ck-off\n  * $5 Ticket (Dance Party only)(+tax & eventbrite fees)\n\n\nPle
 ase have your ID ready to be checked at the door!\n\n\nVenue is 19+ after
  11PM\n\n\nHow to register for TRIVIA:\n\n  * Grab your $15 ticket on eve
 ntbrite\n  * After you register & pay\, you will be prompted to input you
 r team name\n  * Ensure everyone on your team signs up with the same team
  name\, and you will be sat together\n  * Reserving your ticket secures y
 ou a reservation at The Rec Room\n\n\nHow to register for the Community T
 able or attend solo:\n\n  * If you are looking to meet new people and joi
 n a new team\, please put "Community" under the team name prompt\n  * You
  will be sat at our Community Table\, where other individuals or smaller 
 groups signed up happy to meet new people!\n  * You can sign up for a com
 munity table with a friend or two\, or solo!\n\n\nTrivia details:\n\n  * 
 Questions include name the song\, singer\, finish the lyric\, and more!\n
   * Team size is recommended 1-6 people. If you'd like to play with a lar
 ger team\, 2 points per additional player over 6 will be deducted from yo
 ur score\, to a max of 8 people.\n  * Top 3 teams win a $100 Rec Room gif
 tcard!\n\n\nMeet your host: Quizmaster Jess!\n\nShe's been hosting themed
  trivia nights for 7 years in Toronto and is such a vibe. Follow her on i
 nstagram: @quizmasterjess https://www.instagram.com/quizmasterjess/ .\n\n
 \nSEE YOU THERE!
