SUMMARY: MORE NOISE PLEASE! x COWARD PATROL PRESENT: SEVERE EXPOSURE! w/ 
 Vomir / Lea Bertucci / HERMIT / MOUND OF GLASS / Professor A / Zilmrah / 
 Rob Michalchuk / RECEIVING DEVICE / Brigitte Bardon't / COLBY RICHARDSON
DESCRIPTION:DO NOT MISS THE PREMIERE OF TORONTO'S NEW NOISE FESTIVAL!\n\n
 VOMIR - Harsh Noise Wall (Paris\, France)\n\nLEA BERTUCCI- Experimental S
 ound Sorceress (NY)\n\nHERMIT - Noise Performance (Vancouver Island)\n\n\
 nSUNKEN CHEEK - Misery Electronics/Harsh Noise (Ithaca\, NY)\n\nPROFESSOR
  A - Anti-Colonial Noise ( Philly)\n\nZILMRAH - Noise/Drone (Brooklyn)\n\
 n\nROB MICHALCHUK - Dungeon-Sax (Brantford)\n\nRECEIVING DEVICE - Harsh N
 oise (London\, ON)\n\nBRIGITTE BARDON'T - Pop Concrète\n\nLive Visuals by
