SUMMARY: Embroidery and Watercolor Workshop
DESCRIPTION:A beginner-friendly workshop where you'll learn the basics of
  embroidery and discover how to incorporate watercolour with embroidery t
 o create charming\, fall-inspired designs.\n\nNo prior experience require
 d\; come as you are\, and all materials are provided. By the end of the s
 ession\, you'll take home a cute\, small piece of fabric art that you mad
 e yourself!\n\nWhat you'll learn\n\n  * Embroidery basics: Get familiar w
 ith embroidery hoops\, needles\, threads\, and how to prepare your fabric
 .\n  * Two foundational stitches: Learn the back stitch and French knot\,
  and practice using them to create simple motifs.\n  * Watercolour on fab
 ric: Learn how to use watercolour to create soft washes and colourful bac
 kgrounds on fabric.\n  * Combining paint & thread: Explore how watercolou
 r and embroidery can work together\, and use your painted fabric as a can
 vas for your stitches.\n  * Create your own fall-inspired piece: Bring ev
 erything together to embroider a cute autumn or Halloween-inspired motif 
 — think pumpkins\, apples\, ghosts\, and more!
CATEGORIES:Workshop
