 p your tips\, or ride that bender. Join us for a late check-out and reset
  your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social.\n\n#WiggleRoomTo
 ronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\n\nEvery funky Sunday funday\, at your se
 rvice!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & STRONG https://on.soundcloud.com
 /yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\nCOMPLIMENTARY Entry before 10p
 m with RSVP\nOpen at 8pm ~ $6 Vodka & Beer specials before 11pm\n\nit's a
  Sunday thang...\n\nSun Nov 1: ADDY | Manzone & Strong | Mike Dunn [Bday 
 Beats] | My Girl Tuesday | TRISTAN [Bday Beats]\n\nRSVP & Advance Tickets
 :\nThe Wiggler: $23 (includes Coat or Bag Check)\nDo you know who I am? (
 FREE before 10pm)\n\nPerformers:\n8-9:30 TRISTAN\n9:30-11 By Girl Tuesday
