SUMMARY: Glory (1989)
DESCRIPTION:The Platypus Affiliated Society organizes reading groups\, pu
 blic fora\, research and journalism focused on the problems and tasks inh
 erited from the "Old" (1920s–30s)\, "New" (1960s–70s) and post-political 
 (1980s–90s) Left for the possibilities of emancipatory politics today.\n\
 nThe Toronto chapter is hosting a screening of the 1989 civil war film Gl
 ory\, directed by Edward Zwick and starring Denzel Washington and Matthew
  Broderick. Admittance is pay what you can. All are welcome and we hope y
 ou'll join us for drinks and discussion of the film after the screening.\
 n\nPWYC
