SUMMARY: Madam Wiggle's Unicorn Party: NATHAN BARATO
DESCRIPTION:Sat Nov 7: Madam Wiggle's Annual Unicorn Party\nNATHAN BARATO
  | TAKiN | Tyler Hill | Nour | Barroness & Dick Diamonds | 3ROC & Wiley C
 oyoto| NostraBrammus | Bigfoot\n\nThe unicorns are coming!\nDo you identi
 fy as a unicorn? Join the annual gathering\, in celebration of Lindsay Fa
 y\, Acacia\, Ehsan\, and all you crazy Scorpio birthday's. Expect glitter
  farts and rainbow hearts stomping to the bounciest beats.\n\nThis is one
  of Wiggly Events' flagship events\, and it sells out every year. We high
 ly recommend securing tix in advance to avoid waiting in line at arrival.
  Ticket holders will get priority entry.\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wigg
 leroomtoronto.com/event/madam-wiggles-%f0%9f%a6%84-unicorn-%f0%9f%a6%84-p
 arty-nathan-barato/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler: $30\n\nPerformances
 :\n10-11 NostraBrammus\n11-12 Wiley Coyote & 3ROC\n12-1 TAKiN\n1-2 TYLER 
 HILL\n2-4 NATHAN BARATO\n4-5 NOUR\n5-close Barroness & Dick Diamonds\nVJ 
 SEKS\n\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\n\nOptions for pre
 paid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = everything mentioned):\n\n1) The
  3rd Wheel: $363\nincludes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodk
 a\n\n2) Regular Package: $700\nincludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular
  Bottles of Choice (may email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@
 gmail.com to specify choice)\n\n3) Premium Package: $900\nincludes: 6 Gen
 eral Admissions\; 2 Premium Bottles of Choice (email wigglyevents@gmail.c
 om mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n\nTo Arrange Special
  Packages - wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold se
 parately from admission)\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ event\n\nh
 osted by: Wiggly Events\; and Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\
 ; OG Entertainment\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of co
 nduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is 
 a Safer Dance Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage everyone n
 ot to hesitate to bring to our attention anything you think that we shoul
 d be made aware of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal space\, s
 olicitation or use of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\
 , or anything else that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or others. Y
 ou may use the safe word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\, and
  we will direct you to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are in ma
 rked clothing. Our team and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, N
 our Bawab\, Christina Barron\, Tyler Hill\, Mitch (lead security)\, Moniq
 ue\, and Tanya\, are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St W
 est
