 eet W\, Toronto\, ON M6H 1L5\n\nGeneral admission: $25.\n\n\nFeaturing: A
 tharv Mahajan\, Sarah Bransfield\, Mnrupe Virk\, Mo Habob\, Pavel Sotniko
 v\, Rochelle Bechard\, Jared Nathan\, Kristin Doucet and Husein Panju.\n\
