SUMMARY: Sunday SerVice: KENNY GLASGOW | Manzone & Strong | 4AM LAST CALL
DESCRIPTION:Thank Goodness It's Sunday :)| 4AM LAST CALL\n\nPut on your S
 unday best\, sip your tips\, or ride that bender. Join us for a late chec
 k-out and reset your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social.\n
 \n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\n\nEvery funky Sunday fund
 ay\, at your service!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & STRONG https://on
 .soundcloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\nCOMPLIMENTARY E
 ntry before 10pm with RSVP\nOpen at 8pm\n\nit's a Sunday thang...\n\nSun 
 Nov 15: KENNY GLASGOW | Manzone & Strong | Barroness | KTD\n\nRSVP & Adva
 nce Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/sunday-service-kenny-gla
 sgow-manzone-strong-4am-last-call/\nThe Wiggler: $23 (includes Coat or Ba
 g Check)\nDo you know who I am? (FREE before 10pm)\n\nPerformers:\n8-10 K
 TD\n10-12 Barroness\n12-2 KENNY GLASGOW [House Set]\n2-close Manzone & St
 rong\nVJ Amir Nian\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages & Table Reservations - 
 wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately fro
 m admission)\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n19+ event\n\nHosted by: To
 ronto House Community / Wiggly Events / Manzone & Strong / Sunshine Frequ
 encies / Wiggle Room Toronto\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict 
 code of conduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggl
 e Room is a Safer Dance Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage 
 everyone not to hesitate to bring to our attention anything you think tha
 t we should be made aware of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal
  space\, solicitation or use of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated 
 behaviour\, or anything else that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or
  others. You may use the safe word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Ba
 nana\, and we will direct you to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff
  are in marked clothing. Our team and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Linds
 ay Fay\, Tyler Hill\, DTM (coat check)\, and Monique (bar) are all availa
 ble.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
