SUMMARY: Animal Instinx: HECTOR ROMERO [NYC]
DESCRIPTION:Sat Nov 21: HECTOR ROMERO [NYC]\nTAKiN | Paolo | Melanie Suth
 erland | 3ROC | Latex Barbie\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoront
 o.com/event/animal-instinx-hector-romero-nyc/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wi
 ggler: $30\n\nTHE WILD IS CALLING. ARE YOU READY TO UNLEASH IT?\n\nGet re
 ady to go WILD as Animal Instix returns for its 4th annual takeover! It's
  time to shed your inhibitions\, embrace your animal instincts\, and let 
 your inner beast run free on the dance floor.\n\nANIMAL PRINTS. WILD COST
 UMES. UNTAMED ENERGY.\n\nPull out your leopard spots\, tiger stripes\, fu
 rry fits\, wild accessories\, and your most outrageous animal-inspired lo
 oks. Whether you're a fierce feline\, a sneaky snake\, a wild wolf\, or a
 n entirely new species\, this is your chance to get creative and unleash 
 your wild side. Expect wild beats\, untamed energy\, and a dance floor fu
 ll of creatures of the night.\n\nNo cages. No inhibitions.\n\nLET YOUR IN
 NER ANIMAL OUT TO PLAY.\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com
 /event/animal-instinx-hector-romero-nyc/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler
 : $30\n\nPerformances:\n10-11:30 Latex Barbie\n11:30-12:30 TAKiN\n12:30-3
  HECTOR ROMERO\n3-close 3ROC b2b Paolo + Melanie Sutherland\n\n#WiggleRoo
 mToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket pack
 ages (ONE ticket = everything mentioned):\n\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nIncl
 udes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodka\n\n2) Regular Packag
 e: $700\nIncludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (ma
 y email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify c
 hoice)\n\n3) Premium Package: $900\nIncludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Pr
 emium Bottles of Choice (email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents
 @gmail.com to specify choice)\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages: wigglyevent
 s@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from admission
 )\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ event\n\nHosted by: 1lvl1 Enterta
 inment\; Wiggly Events\; Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\n\n~ 
 WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the ri
 ght to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space. We 
 take this very seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate to bring 
 to our attention anything you think that we should be made aware of\, suc
 h as harassment\, violation of personal space\, solicitation or use of co
 ntrolled substances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything else that 
 may pose a risk or discomfort to you or others. You may use the safe word
  BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct you to a
  safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are in marked clothing. Our team 
 and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Nour Bawab\, Christina Ba
 rron\, Tyler Hill\, Mitch (lead security)\, and Tanya\, are all available
 .\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
