DESCRIPTION:We are back with our annual ugly sweater show! If you made it
  out in past years you know how much of a blast this emo party is!\n\nEye
 s Like Static will be throwing their annual Ugly Emo Christmas Sweater Pa
 rty Show at Nickel 9 Distillery and Samara Brewing in the Junction area o
 f Toronto on December 12th.\n\nThis is an All Ages event so come on out!\
 n\nIf you're a fan of pop punk and emo covers you need to make it out to 
 this event. With over 2 hours of live music from Eyes Like Static playing
  hits from bands such as Blink 182\, Green Day\, My Chemical Romance\, Pa
 ramore\, Jimmy Eat World\, Sum 41 and so much more.\n\nStop by for some g
 reat food\, emo-infused cocktails\, beers and live music. Be sure to put 
 on your best ugly Christmas sweater for the evening. Nickel 9 Distillery 
 and Samara Brewing will be providing multiple prizes for best dressed so 
 wear your ugliest sweater!
